    "detailed_description": "<strong>Do you like 2D platformer games</strong>? <br>That's a good thing! <strong>Inversed World</strong> is <u>exactly such a game</u>! <br><strong>Pass the game in the shortest possible time or jump endlessly on endless mode!</strong> <br><strong>It's up to you</strong> which gameplay mode you choose!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description!</h2> <strong>Inversed World</strong> is a simple 2D styled platform game created specifically for speedruns. <br>The task of the player, is to pass 20 levels using various mechanics in the shortest possible time. <br>Time is counted down from the moment you move.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes!</h2> <strong>In the game we have 2 game modes to choose from</strong>. <br><br><strong>Speedrun mode</strong> - We have to pass the game in <u>the shortest possible time</u>! <br><strong>Endless mode</strong> - The player goes through <u>endless game mode</u>, earning more and more points!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements!</h2> There are <strong>only 5 achievements</strong> in the game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord Server!</h2>",
